  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6302.04 “Alcohol concentration” means grams of alcohol per 210 liters of breath (g/210L) as defined in RSA 259:3-b.\n\nSource. #8064, INTERIM, eff 4-1-04, EXPIRES: 9-28-04 (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6300); ss by #8114, eff 7-14-04; ss by #9683, eff 3-23-10; renumbered by #12064 (formerly Saf-C 6301.04)",
